  "label": "Heaven as an Idealized Space",
  "description": "The phrase 'this is what I imagine heaven looks like' is a cultural trope used to express a fantasy or idealized vision of perfection. In this meme, it is used ironically to mock the stereotype by suggesting that the woman’s environment (a wine aisle) is so pleasant or desirable that it resembles heaven — a contrast that highlights the absurdity or superficiality of the stereotype.",
